    knobs: ['Link generation and width negotiated per device (firmware, risers, power settings)', 'ACS enabled/disabled per switch port', 'IOMMU on/off or passthrough mode', 'Device placement: GPU and NIC under the same switch', 'Pinned vs pageable host buffers', 'Transfer sizes (large batched copies vs many small ones)'],
    metrics: ['Negotiated link speed/width (`nvidia-smi -q`, `lspci -vv LnkSta`)', 'H2D/D2H bandwidth in `bandwidthTest` or `nsys` timelines', 'P2P bandwidth and latency (`p2pBandwidthLatencyTest`)', 'PCIe replay and error counters (`nvidia-smi -q -d PCIE`, AER logs in `dmesg`)'],
